{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_149_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0df8f11934ddd5f2faf556510379494d2872369bb69dc80da5b7fdbfb3cc97fc", "ja": "い、いやでも、悪い話じゃないぞ？\n公演に来られなかったファンの人達、それに……。", "zh": "不、不是，但这也不是什么坏事吧？\n没能来到公演现场的粉丝们，还有……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_149_1008_p", "source_sha256": "3e93523bede9265e952596f65c80872e5d832021cc164d2fe8e2946d2dffbbb2", "ja": "これから雪歩を好きになってくれる人も。\n今よりもっと、たくさんの人達に見てもらえるんだ！", "zh": "还有今后会喜欢上雪步的人。\n这样一来，就能让比现在更多的人看到她了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_149_1009_004yuk", "source_sha256": "40649e9cc8c9545671435808578c3466c1a854f6db247ecb5b4e35835cfc55b0", "ja": "たくさんの……あっ！　じゃあ、どこかで\n宇宙人が見てくれるかもしれませんね！", "zh": "很多……啊！那说不定在某个地方，\n外星人也会看到我们呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_149_1010_p", "source_sha256": "f7b157dba4d1ae4ca683ce30bab37312a59f3396c73e7a7e58ad9b42c2c07680", "ja": "えっ？　……あ、ああ、そうかもな。\nうん、可能性は無限大だ。", "zh": "诶？……啊、啊，也许吧。\n嗯，可能性是无限的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_149_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_149_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "245aea65cf810d91ff9dbb310b79d42daf51e7f56f9d9111ecd7e84c2390c179", "ja": "それでファンになってもらったら、\n握手会とかサイン会にも来てもらえて……。", "zh": "这样一来，要是能让他们成为粉丝，\n说不定还会来参加握手会和签名会……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
